    }
  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The only thing stopping method 1 from being in place is the extra matrix.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 5680,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 170,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "So what happens if we remove it?",
      "start_ms": 6160,
      "end_ms": 9520,
      "start_frame": 185,
      "end_frame": 286,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Suppose we try to move values directly inside the original matrix.",
      "start_ms": 10220,
      "end_ms": 16000,
      "start_frame": 307,
      "end_frame": 480,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Look at the first corner.",
      "start_ms": 16860,
      "end_ms": 18080,
      "start_frame": 506,
      "end_frame": 542,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "One needs to move into the current position of 5.",
      "start_ms": 18760,
      "end_ms": 22380,
      "start_frame": 563,
      "end_frame": 671,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "But if we immediately write 1 over 5, the old value 5 disappears.",
      "start_ms": 22820,
      "end_ms": 29500,
      "start_frame": 685,
      "end_frame": 885,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "And we still need 5 because 5 must move to another position.",
      "start_ms": 30000,
      "end_ms": 35040,
      "start_frame": 900,
      "end_frame": 1051,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "So this creates an overwrite problem.",
      "start_ms": 35700,
      "end_ms": 38700,
      "start_frame": 1071,
      "end_frame": 1161,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "The values are not moving independently.",
      "start_ms": 39400,
      "end_ms": 42360,
      "start_frame": 1182,
      "end_frame": 1271,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "They are connected.",
      "start_ms": 43020,
      "end_ms": 44060,
      "start_frame": 1291,
      "end_frame": 1322,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "1 moves to the position of 5.",
      "start_ms": 44720,
      "end_ms": 47180,
      "start_frame": 1342,
      "end_frame": 1415,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "5 moves to the position of 25.",
      "start_ms": 47560,
      "end_ms": 50480,
      "start_frame": 1427,
      "end_frame": 1514,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "25 moves to the position of 21.",
      "start_ms": 51140,
      "end_ms": 54420,
      "start_frame": 1534,
      "end_frame": 1633,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "And 21 moves back to the original position of 1.",
      "start_ms": 55100,
      "end_ms": 59260,
      "start_frame": 1653,
      "end_frame": 1778,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "So these 4 positions form a closed cycle.",
      "start_ms": 59260,
      "end_ms": 62740,
      "start_frame": 1778,
      "end_frame": 1882,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "That gives us the solution.",
      "start_ms": 63620,
      "end_ms": 65020,
      "start_frame": 1909,
      "end_frame": 1951,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Instead of moving one value alone, we rotate all 4 connected values together.",
      "start_ms": 65720,
      "end_ms": 73320,
      "start_frame": 1972,
      "end_frame": 2200,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "And to prevent data loss, we only need to save one value temporarily.",
      "start_ms": 73920,
      "end_ms": 79380,
      "start_frame": 2218,
      "end_frame": 2381,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Now let's trace the complete in -place rotation.",
      "start_ms": 80220,
      "end_ms": 84080,
      "start_frame": 2407,
      "end_frame": 2522,
      "word_count": 8
    }
  ],
